  "description": "If you love the timeless, unique quality of cromoly then look no further and check out the ever-popular Metropolis with its steel tubes, svelte aesthetics and geometry developed by the best riders in the world.\nThe Metropolis 1 comes with the most advanced spec across the range. It’s an unrivalled package that includes a beautiful steel frame and the legendary Marzocchi Z2 fork with a thru-axle. This bike is ready to unleash the most raucous tricks and super-charged jumps from day one. The hydraulic disc brake on the back will give you all the stopping power you’ll ever need.\nINTENDED USE CATEGORY 5: DIRT JUMP\nMAIN FEATURES\n- Cromoly double butted frame w/taper headtube based on Decade/Majesty geometry\n- Marzocchi bomber z2 E-bike+ 100mm, Boost thru axle & taper steertube\n- NS Bikes aftermarket cockpit\n- Race Face Aeffect crankset\n- Shimano deore REAR brake\n- Sealed bearing hubs, 10t driver, female bolts\n- NS dirt rims\nCUSTOM BUTTED 4130 CROMOLY FRAME\nSIIIIIIICK COLORWAYS\nNS AFTERMARKET COCKPIT",
